sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant TSB as ThemeSwitchButton
    participant VSS as LocalVisualStyleState
    participant VSP as VisualStyleProvider
    participant RP as resolveThemeParams
    participant CS as componentSpecForStyle
    participant GP as LocalGlassPalette
    participant MT as MaterialTheme
    participant SC as SharedComponents (SectionCard等)
    participant CC as CustomComponents (BrushBorder/SealButton...)

    User->>TSB: 点击切换，选 INK_WASH
    TSB->>VSS: onStyleChange(INK_WASH)
    Note over VSS: visualStyleState.value = INK_WASH
    VSS-->>VSP: 触发重组（快照系统）
    VSP->>RP: resolveThemeParams(INK_WASH, isSystemInDarkTheme())
    RP-->>VSP: ThemeParams(InkWashDarkColorScheme, InkWashTypography, InkWashShapes)
    VSP->>CS: componentSpecForStyle(INK_WASH)
    CS-->>VSP: InkWashComponentSpec
    VSP->>GP: INK_WASH != CYBERPUNK → null
    VSP->>MT: MaterialTheme(colorScheme / typography / shapes)
    MT-->>SC: 子树重组
    SC->>SC: 读 LocalComponentSpec.current
    Note over SC: cardShape / borderWidth / dividerThickness<br/>自动适配，零改共享组件

    alt 主题含自定义观感（国风/水墨/赛博）
        SC->>CC: 在对应位置包裹自定义组件
        CC->>CC: 读 LocalVisualStyle 分支（SealButton / BrushBorder / ScanLine）
        CC->>CC: 读 LocalComponentSpec 取圆角/描边（禁硬编码）
    end

    Note over User: 4 套主题可切换<br/>辨识度靠配色 / 圆角 / 描边 / 字体

    rect rgb(235,245,255)
    note over User,GP: 赛博朋克专属路径
    User->>TSB: 选 CYBERPUNK
    TSB->>VSS: onStyleChange(CYBERPUNK)
    VSP->>RP: darkTheme 真/假均返 CyberpunkDarkColorScheme
    VSP->>GP: CYBERPUNK → CyberpunkGlassPalette（霓虹色）
    GP-->>SC: GlassSurface 读 palette + glassEnabled=true
    SC->>SC: 绘制既有 rim / sheen / specular 外发光叠加层
    end
